There's a ton of overplotting in your graph. My suggestion would be to use an alpha rather than a specific color. Something like:

ggplot(dat, aes(x=obs, y=yij)) +
> geom_line(alpha=0.3) +

> guides(colour=FALSE) +
> xlab("Observation Time Point") +
> ylab("Y")

