Ben,

Regarding point 2 there's quite a few extensions already. I bet any of the authors would be willing to adopt your geoms with a little support.

http://www.ggplot2-exts.org/index.html

Bob Rudis (ggalt) & Dean Attali (ggExtra) would be good homes too. I think the author of ggmisc mentioned accepting orphan geom's on Twitter at some point, but I can't find it. Dean mentions on his website that he's trying to graduate though...

B

